D2 SPLIT SUPPLY: DAC drivers on their own strap (series Rs, local decap Cd), comparators + logic on the main rail (decap Cm), both from the same pad pair (R 0.25 ohm, L 2 nH ASSUMED), staggered, SCLK 5 MHz, digital charge off
   e_dac = f*|dVDD of the DAC rail at the comparator clock rise|/LSB (f = 0.5 mid-scale | 1 worst); e_cmp = 0.038 LSB/mV * max|dVDD of the main rail in the 2 ns evaluate window| (D1 fixed-reference sensitivity); total = e_dac + e_cmp
